Critical Rule for Antigravity

First understand the existing repository and working speed-test implementation. Then improve the architecture and UI incrementally. Do not replace working LibreSpeed/Railway measurement logic with simulated or fake speed-test logic. Preserve real measurements and make the UI react to the actual testing lifecycle.